---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="3D Facade Visualization — See Your Home Before Renovation" description="Professional 3D facade visualizations — see the final result before work begins. Color and material selection. Visualizations Krakow." schemaType="services" locale="en">
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-16 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/80 via-slate-900/95 to-slate-900"></div></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-red-600"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8"><a href="/en" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/en/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a><span>/</span><span class="text-orange-400">3D Facade Visualization</span></nav>
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 mb-6"><span class="text-orange-400 text-sm font-semibold">Design</span></div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">3D Facade <span class="text-gradient">Visualization</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">See the final result before facade work begins. We prepare photorealistic 3D visualizations to help you make confident decisions about colors, textures, and materials.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Why choose <span class="text-gradient">3D visualization</span>?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">A facade is a significant investment, and color or material choices are difficult to reverse once work is done. Our 3D visualization service lets you see exactly how your building will look with different options — before committing a single zloty to materials.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">We photograph your building and create a detailed 3D model, then apply different color combinations, plaster textures, and decorative elements. You can compare multiple variants side by side and choose the one that perfectly matches your vision.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The visualization service is available as a standalone consultation or included free of charge with full facade execution contracts. We also help with color coordination, material selection, and architectural detail planning.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">See your new facade <span class="text-gradient">before renovation</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Contact us for a 3D visualization consultation. Eliminate uncertainty and make confident design decisions.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors">Request visualization</a>
        <a href="tel:+48515156233" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-colors">Call: 515-156-233</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
